      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled and welcoming grooming stylists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers consistently appreciate the stability and welcoming demeanor of the salon team on Sepulveda Boulevard. Stylists including Jessica, Demareo, Cedric, and Sara receive regular praise for listening closely to owner preferences and explaining grooming steps. Clients also value being able to return to the same familiar groomer across visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean cuts and refreshing baths"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners generally express high satisfaction with full haircuts, thorough wash routines, and coat maintenance. Dogs routinely return looking refreshed and smelling clean. Although most appointments match requests, one client noted miscommunication regarding haircut length and nail trimming when declining salon package extras."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle patience with sensitive dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the tender care shown to aging dogs and anxious pets who dislike nail trims, baths, or brushing. Stylists take time to keep senior dogs comfortable, remember returning pets by name, and adjust handling techniques to reduce nervous tension during appointments."
      }
    }
  ],
